# decisions

2 documents on this shelf, in the reading order this corpus derives. Each heading below is the name that the document declares, so a citation of a heading is a citation of a document.

## Rebuild the graph on every run

[DR-FIX-0002](0002-rebuild-the-graph.md) — the graph is rebuilt on every run and never stored, which supersedes DR-FIX-0001

## Store the graph on disk

[DR-FIX-0001](0001-store-the-graph.md) — the first ruling on where the corpus graph lives, replaced by DR-FIX-0002

